" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (relation code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula-code set for language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\)</span> (assignment predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (satisfaction data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> (model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9SatisfactionRelationCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9SatisfactionRelationCode}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}relation\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9SatisfactionRelationCode}_S(R,M,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow \\exists T,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\mathcal A_M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Model}_S(M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathcal A_M=\\{a:\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\}\\land R\\subseteq\\Phi\\times\\mathcal A_M\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;(\\langle\\varphi,a\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,a))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}relation\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9SatisfactionRelationCode}_S(R,M,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow \\exists T,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\mathcal A_M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Model}_S(M,T,L)\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathcal A_M=\\{a:\\mathrm{Assign}(M,a)\\}\\land R\\subseteq\\Phi\\times\\mathcal A_M\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathcal A_M\\;(\\langle\\varphi,a\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,a))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary satisfaction coding definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","t